                  },
                  {
                    "question": "If x:y = 3:4 and y:z = 2:3, find x:z.",
                    "correctAnswer": "1:2",
                    "options": ["1:2", "2:1", "3:2", "2:3"],
                    "instruction": "x/y = 3/4 and y/z = 2/3. Multiply: (x/y)*(y/z) = x/z = (3/4)*(2/3) = 6/12 = 1/2. So x:z = 1:2.",
