                    "question": "Find the derivative of y = 2 cos(3x).",
                    "correctAnswer": "-6 sin(3x)",
                    "options": ["-6 sin(3x)", "6 sin(3x)", "-2 sin(3x)", "2 sin(3x)"],
                    "instruction": "d/dx [cos(ax)] = -a sin(ax). So d/dx [2 cos(3x)] = 2 * (-3 sin(3x)) = -6 sin(3x).",
