                    "instruction": "27^(x-1) = (3³)^(x-1) = 3^(3x-3). So 3^(2x) = 3^(3x-3) => 2x = 3x-3 => x = 3.",
                    "code": "JMATH_14_092"
                  },
                  {
                    "question": "If the roots of a quadratic equation are 3 and -2, find the equation.",
                    "correctAnswer": "x² - x - 6 = 0",
                    "options": ["x² + x - 6 = 0", "x² - x - 6 = 0", "x² + x + 6 = 0", "x² - x + 6 = 0"],
                    "instruction": "Sum = 1, product = -6. Equation: x² - (sum)x + product = x² - x - 6 = 0.",
                    "code": "JMATH_14_093"
                  },
                  {
                    "question": "If y = 2x² - 3x + 1, find the value of y when x = 2.",
                    "correctAnswer": "3",
                    "options": ["3", "5", "7", "9"],
                    "instruction": "y = 2(4) - 3(2) + 1 = 8 - 6 + 1 = 3.",
                    "code": "JMATH_14_094"
                  },
                  {
                    "question": "Find the number of sides of a polygon whose sum of interior angles is 720°.",
                    "correctAnswer": "6",
                    "options": ["4", "5", "6", "7"],
                    "instruction": "(n-2) × 180 = 720 => n-2 = 4 => n = 6.",
                    "code": "JMATH_14_095"
                  },
                  {
                    "question": "If 0.05 of a number is 20, find the number.",
                    "correctAnswer": "400",
                    "options": ["40", "100", "400", "1000"],
                    "instruction": "0.05n = 20 => n = 20/0.05 = 2000/5 = 400.",
                    "code": "JMATH_14_096"
                  },
                  {
                    "question": "Find the derivative of y = 7x⁵ - 4x³ + 2x.",
                    "correctAnswer": "35x⁴ - 12x² + 2",
                    "options": ["35x⁴ - 12x² + 2", "35x⁴ - 12x²", "35x⁴ + 12x² + 2", "7x⁴ - 4x² + 2"],
                    "instruction": "Apply power rule: d/dx (xⁿ) = n xⁿ⁻¹.",
                    "code": "JMATH_14_097"
                  },
                  {
                    "question": "If x:y = 2:3 and y:z = 6:5, find x:z.",
                    "correctAnswer": "4:5",
                    "options": ["2:5", "3:5", "4:5", "5:4"],
                    "instruction": "x/y = 2/3, y/z = 6/5. Multiply: x/z = (2/3)*(6/5) = 12/15 = 4/5 => x:z = 4:5.",
                    "code": "JMATH_14_098"
                  },
                  {
                    "question": "Find the value of ₈C₅.",
                    "correctAnswer": "56",
                    "options": ["56", "336", "6720", "40320"],
                    "instruction": "₈C₅ = ₈C₃ = (8×7×6)/(3×2×1) = 336/6 = 56.",
                    "code": "JMATH_14_099"
                  },
                  {
                    "question": "If 2x + 3y = 13 and 4x - y = 5, find x + y.",
                    "correctAnswer": "5",
                    "options": ["2", "3", "4", "5"],
                    "instruction": "Solve: From second, y = 4x - 5. Substitute: 2x + 3(4x-5) = 13 => 2x + 12x -15 = 13 => 14x = 28 => x = 2, y = 3. x+y = 5.",
                    "code": "JMATH_14_100"
                  }
