                    "instruction": "Cost price = 230/1.15 = ₦200. New selling price ₦180 gives loss of ₦20. Loss % = (20/200) × 100% = 10% [citation:1].",
                    "code": "JMATH_23_007"
                  },
                  {
                    "question": "The perimeter of an isosceles right-angled triangle is 2 meters. Find the length of its longer side.",
                    "correctAnswer": "0.828 m",
