                    "instruction": "Sides: 2x+3x+4x = 180 → 9x = 180 → x = 20. Sides = 40, 60, 80 cm. Use Heron's formula: s = 90. Area = √[90(90-40)(90-60)(90-80)] = √(90×50×30×10) = √1,350,000 = 1161.9 ≈ 1162 cm² [citation:1].",
