                    "instruction": "ar = -2/3, a/(1-r) = 3/2. Substitute a = (-2/3)/r. Solve: (-2/3)/(r(1-r)) = 3/2 → cross multiply and solve for r [citation:1].",
                    "code": "JMATH_23_015"
